WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.169
Two, three, four!

00:00:02.169 --> 00:00:05.672
Oh, wait. We almost forgot
about our special guest.

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:06.840
Helpsters!

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.800
Santigold!

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.013
Helpsters, we start looping our
sounds when Santigold tells us

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.932
and then stop
when she stops singing.

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:15.849
Sound good?

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:16.975
Oh yeah,
sounds great.

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:18.644
All right, Mr. Primm.
You got this.

00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:20.145
Ready? Hit it!

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:24.066
[VOCALIZING]
[SNAPPING]

00:00:24.066 --> 00:00:26.360
All right, sounding good.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:27.402
Scatter!

00:00:27.402 --> 00:00:29.571
[VOCALIZING]
[SNAPPING]

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:30.948
All right, Heart. You got this.

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:33.408
Yeah, you do.

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:34.201
Heart!

00:00:34.201 --> 00:00:38.538
[BEATBOXING]
Woo! All right.

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:39.289
Cody.

00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:40.457
Yeah? Oh, I'm next.

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:41.875
And go!

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:47.798
[VOCALIZING]
[BEATBOXING]

00:00:47.798 --> 00:00:50.092
♪ I like mittens on my hands. ♪

00:00:50.092 --> 00:00:53.220
♪ I highly recommend
that one big fluffy pocket ♪

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:55.472
♪ so your fingers
can be friends. ♪

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:59.017
♪ Mittens can't be beat
for keeping body heat. ♪

00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:00.310
♪ Socks are super too, ♪

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:02.020
♪ they're like the mittens
of the feet. ♪

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:05.899
♪ So call me smitten. ♪

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:09.194
♪ Yeah, call me smitten. ♪

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:10.904
♪ I like mittens. ♪

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:13.782
Oh, that was so great,
Santigold! Thank you.

00:01:13.782 --> 00:01:15.951
♪ Helpsters! ♪

00:01:15.951 --> 00:01:21.623
♪

